{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2119", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2119/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2119/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2119/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2119", "id": 1857299801, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5utCVZ", "number": 2119, "title": "Can't do goto_location or do_orbit with C++ SDK", "user": {"login": "SebastianRosewick", "id": 102235873, "node_id": "U_kgDOBhf-4Q", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102235873?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick", "html_url": "https://github.com/SebastianRosewick", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/SebastianRosewick/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 7, "created_at": "2023-08-18T21:15:30Z", "updated_at": "2023-08-23T23:59:53Z", "closed_at": "2023-08-23T23:59:53Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\ni am having trouble with the C++ SDK. I am using v1.4.15 with PX4 sitl and gazebo garden.\r\n\r\nProblem Description:\r\nI can't command the x500 quadcopter to reposition neither to do orbits. I tried using the mavsdk::Action Plugin with goto_location() and do_orbit() as well as sending a CommandInt with the MavlinkPassthrough Plugin.\r\nThis causes the quadcopter to land immediately. However, the commands are submitted successfully and no error is being logged.\r\nI also can see the messages and ACKs being sent when debugging with the wireshark lua-plugin.\r\nSending the commands manually with QGC does work as well as the Python example for do_orbit.\r\n\r\nHow to reproduce:\r\n`make px4_sitl_default gz_x500`\r\n\r\nTo isolate the problem, i added this bit of code in the takeoff_and_land example, after the system has taken off and waited for a few seconds:\r\n\r\n``` auto orbit_res = action.do_orbit(20.f, 2.f, mavsdk::Action::OrbitYawBehavior::HoldFrontToCircleCenter, 47.398036222362471, 8.5450146439425509, 2.5);\r\n    std::cout << \"Orbit_Res: \" << orbit_res << std::endl;\r\n    if(orbit_res == mavsdk::Action::Result::Success){\r\n        sleep_for(seconds(30));\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe result is that do_orbit returns SUCCESS but the drone lands immediately.\r\nA zipped flight log is attached.\r\n\r\nAny help would be much appreciated!\r\n[log_17_2023-8-18-23-08-13.ulg.zip](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/files/12384017/log_17_2023-8-18-23-08-13.ulg.zip)\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avata